{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785520833796619002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"affable-soulless-gosling","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"54650b0d3bd3cc00c3dea5f4302a87a3de31f0222904a9773d284652b022b954","event_uuid":"5aad06f0-4a4f-4c5a-981f-c71f0fca2321","position":{"commit_sha":"f30ee3da768f83b97ff929ba7a9574463528dc31","position":"1785520786072205001-5aad06f0-4a4f-4c5a-981f-c71f0fca2321"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"8dd4d5d5f06384d54415a146cfc93d424beb41175778733efaefa27b5ffa4eed","event_uuid":"dac88e7f-10c3-4692-82ac-c6fc90cf23f8","position":{"commit_sha":"745f062378274acb4eed0baaf0840e18f2f1b7c3","position":"1785520810936810001-dac88e7f-10c3-4692-82ac-c6fc90cf23f8"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"89136232d3f961d2bb6a36546aeabb594aaf0a67bf67e90ed804b4d37980ab5c","event_uuid":"c08b753d-b06c-4abc-8319-20debca80919","position":{"commit_sha":"7adf119ada9a1b35421fbeb85192cc76473f1f7d","position":"1785520833796619001-c08b753d-b06c-4abc-8319-20debca80919"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1785520786072205001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"dac88e7f-10c3-4692-82ac-c6fc90cf23f8","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"5f48-244c-7063-42d0"},{"link_uuid":"c08b753d-b06c-4abc-8319-20debca80919","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"8070-3f8b-8e71-483b"}],"description":"## Reported by, not investigated by, an adjacent session\n\nSurfaced while confirming the fix for bug 8070 (external-integration canary). Per operator\ninstruction this was NOT investigated — epic e369 is actively held by another session and owns this\nsubject matter. Filing it here so the owning session sees it. **The root cause below is a candidate,\nnot a finding.**\n\n## Observed (live CI, reproducible)\n\nRun 30651750699 — `workflow_dispatch` of `.github/workflows/external-integration.yml` on `main` at\ncommit `b7e6ac963`, 2026-07-31. Job **\"jira DC harness smoke (real Jira Data Center, ephemeral)\"**:\n\n```\ntests/external/live_jira_dc/test_reconcile_pass.py:319\nAssertionError: no local ticket was created from DC issue RBJNAZV-1;\n  stdout='invariants: scanned=1 filed=0 (cap=5)\\nOK: applied 1 of 1 mutations\\n'\nassert []\nFAILED test_reconcile_pass.py::test_a_dc_created_ticket_carries_the_shared_jira_provenance\n```\n\nThe failing test is `test_a_dc_created_ticket_carries_the_shared_jira_provenance`.\n\n## Why this is newly visible\n\nThis failure was previously MASKED. Until `b7e6ac963` the whole external tier died at\n`SnapshotRefError` on an unborn `HEAD` before reaching any behaviour under test (bug 8070). With\nsnapshot resolution fixed, the tier now reaches its subject and this assertion fails on its merits.\nSo this is very likely a pre-existing defect that the canary could not previously report, not a new\nregression from `b7e6ac963` — which touched only `tests/external/conftest.py` (adds an empty root\ncommit) and added a unit test.\n\n## Candidate cause — UNCONFIRMED, do not treat as diagnosed\n\n`scanned=1 filed=0` says the inbound record was seen and then not filed. That shape is consistent\nwith OPEN bug **5f48-244c-7063-42d0** — \"DC inbound identity mint fails silently: 'jira-datacenter'\nis not a valid creation_channel\" — where a silent mint failure would drop the record between scan\nand file. Linked `relates_to`. If that is the cause, this ticket is a duplicate and should be closed\nas such rather than worked separately.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] The mechanism behind `scanned=1 filed=0` is identified and cited (`path:line`), and it is\n      determined whether this is the same defect as 5f48 (close as duplicate) or distinct.\n- [ ] `test_a_dc_created_ticket_carries_the_shared_jira_provenance` passes against the live DC\n      harness, or the failure is guarded by a credential-free test in the default suite.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","e369-a449-4773-48fb"],["relates_to","5f48-244c-7063-42d0"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"e369-a449-4773-48fb","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"0059-c7f0-cce1-4077","ticket_type":"bug","title":"DC inbound filing is a no-op in live CI: reconcile reports scanned=1 filed=0, no local ticket created from DC issue","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["5aad06f0-4a4f-4c5a-981f-c71f0fca2321","dac88e7f-10c3-4692-82ac-c6fc90cf23f8","c08b753d-b06c-4abc-8319-20debca80919"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785520833796619002,"uuid":"d6dbfe9c-7194-4654-84bd-6a9bd5b96405"}